==Battleground==
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Christmas D.]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Ranged attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] will help here, since they can easily kill the Blitzen as long as you send some [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] to protect them. [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] can also be helpful, as all of the boss wave enemies are [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]].

